  "Deal <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> ATK Bless damage to all foes, restore <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> HP to all allies and give all allies 1 stack of Blessing. gain [Truth], then gain [Clarity] for $3 turns. Under [Clarity], increase all allies' DMG Dealt by <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color>.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>The light suddenly bloomed, and the aftermath of the explosion swept out, carrying endless light and power, causing indelible damage to the foe.</color></size></b>": "",
