  "Use condition: When Akechi has [Truth]\\nSpend all [Arrow of Clarity] stacks, deal fixed Almighty damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of the damage recorded by each [Arrow of Clarity] stack. Then, activate [Arrow of Chaos] on random foes, dealing Almighty damage equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> ($2 hits). From the second hit, prioritize new targets, and decrease damage to $4 for hits on the same target.\\nIf Akechi has [Detective Partner], [Arrow of Clarity] gains $5 of the Almighty damage of [Arrow of Chaos].\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Justice is transformed into sharp arrows that inflict fatal damage on all foes, and any resistance and counterattacks will come to nothing in the face of justice.</color></size></b>": "",
