  "Walking in Fog": "",
  "At the start of battle, grant [Detective Partner] to the ally with the highest ATK (prioritizing Sweepers or Assassins, select Akechi if no target found). At the start of each turn, Akechi can manually reselect a target to grant [Detective Partner]. Only 1 ally can have [Detective Partner] at one time (reselecting has a cooldown of 1 turn). Increase Akechi's ATK by $1 of the [Detective Partner]'s ATK (up to a maximum of $2/$3/$4, at level $5/$6/$7, respectively). When the [Detective Partner] deal damage to all foes with a Persona skill/HIGHLIGHT/{{C}}/Follow Up, record the average damage dealt to all foes (if targeting 1 foe, record $8 of the damage dealt). At the start of Akechi's turn, gain 1 [Arrow of Clarity] stack based on the amount of damage recorded, and reset the recorded damage. Lasts for $9 turns. When Akechi has [Detective Partner], the effect of [Golden Arrow Rain·Annihilate] changes, and [Arrow of Clarity] deals Almighty damage based on the skill multiplier or [Arrow of Chaos].": "",
